Proposition 9.1. Within the reduced model and its structural extensions:

\text{Capability Autonomy viable}\iff r_H\ge r_H^{\mathrm{crit}}.

\text{Structural Autonomy viable}\iff X_H>0,\ R>0,\ M_H>0.

\text{Constitutional Autonomy viable}\iff U_H\ge U_{\min}^{(c)}

for some normative constitutional floor U_{\min}^{(c)}.

